@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Our Medical Services";
}

<section class="bg-primary text-white text-center py-5" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 74, 153, 0.9), rgba(0, 40, 90, 0.95));">
    <div class="container py-3">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">Level 4 Hospital Clinical Services</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-0">Comprehensive, professional health care configured to meet your needs.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="container my-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="text-dark fw-bold">Our Medical Offerings</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width: 650px;">Immaculate Heart Hospital Kereita operates full-scale clinical workflows to support emergency diagnostics, inpatient recovery, and preventive specialties.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card service-card service-card-yellow h-100 p-4 rounded-3">
                <h4 class="text-dark fw-bold mb-2">1. 24/7 Outpatient & Emergency Care</h4>
                <p class="text-dark small">We run continuous outpatient clinical diagnostics, trauma triaging, minor surgical stitches, and medical consultations round the clock. No appointment is needed for urgent emergency care.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card service-card service-card-teal h-100 p-4 rounded-3">
                <h4 class="text-dark fw-bold mb-2">2. Comprehensive Inpatient Wards</h4>
                <p class="text-dark small">Our facility features an organized 36-bed recovery ward capacity split cleanly for patient privacy. Wards are monitored continuously by on-duty clinical officers and nursing practitioners.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card service-card service-card-salmon h-100 p-4 rounded-3">
                <h4 class="text-dark fw-bold mb-2">3. Maternity & Child Health (MCH)</h4>
                <p class="text-dark small">Safe deliveries, comprehensive antenatal checks, fetal monitoring, post-natal counseling, and infant immunization programs aimed at maintaining safe development timelines.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card service-card service-card-lime h-100 p-4 rounded-3">
                <h4 class="text-dark fw-bold mb-2">4. Specialized Chronic Illness Care</h4>
                <p class="text-dark small">Dedicated day clinics optimized for longitudinal monitoring, therapeutic adjustment, and guidance covering Arthritis tracking, Diabetes control, Blood Pressure management, and Tuberculosis regimens.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card service-card service-card-indigo h-100 p-4 rounded-3">
                <h4 class="text-dark fw-bold mb-2">5. Professional Dental Clinic (Kimende Hub)</h4>
                <p class="text-dark small">Operating out of our satellite layout in Kimende, we provide restorative and preventive dental operations including therapeutic root extractions, fillings, deep structural cleaning, and health checks.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card service-card service-card-slate h-100 p-4 rounded-3">
                <h4 class="text-dark fw-bold mb-2">6. Laboratory Diagnostics & Ultrasound</h4>
                <p class="text-dark small">Equipped pathology unit analyzing clinical blood panels, tissue markers, and infectious vectors promptly alongside diagnostic ultrasound imaging components to remove processing bottlenecks.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-12">
            <div class="card border-start border-4 border-success bg-light p-4 shadow-sm rounded-3">
                <h4 class="text-success fw-bold mb-2">7. Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Gym</h4>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Our dedicated physical therapy recovery gym is fitted out to support muscle rebuilding, motor functional tracking following strokes, orthopedic injury recoveries, and chronic pain maintenance routines run under direct specialist overwatch.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>